<p>Cut into an enemy and twist the blade, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">133%, 155%, 172%, 187%, 200%</acronym> damage and increasing the intensity of their existing bleed effects by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">139%, 185%, 221%, 252%, 279%.</acronym></p><p></p><p>Each point in Bloodstained talents reduces the amount of damage you take from bleed effects by 2%</p>